===== reader update =====
>>> CalendarEvent/set {"ifInState": "sa2", "update": {"d": {"title": "mine"}}}
<<< CalendarEvent/set {"accountId": "b", "oldState": "sa2", "newState": "sa2", "notUpdated": {"d": {"type": "forbidden", "description": "You are not allowed to modify this event."}}}

===== reader create =====
>>> CalendarEvent/set {"ifInState": "sa2", "create": {"n": {"@type": "Event", "uid": "n-de8441e6-2ce3-44c4-ac90-56e2ed71704d", "title": "one", "calendarIds": {"b": true}, "start": "2026-10-20T10:00:00", "timeZone": "Etc/UTC", "duration": "PT1H"}}}
<<< CalendarEvent/set {"accountId": "b", "oldState": "sa2", "newState": "sa2", "notCreated": {"n": {"type": "forbidden", "description": "You are not allowed to add calendar events to calendar b."}}}

===== reader destroy =====
>>> CalendarEvent/set {"ifInState": "sa2", "destroy": ["d"]}
<<< CalendarEvent/set {"accountId": "b", "oldState": "sa2", "newState": "sa2", "notDestroyed": {"d": {"type": "forbidden", "description": "You are not allowed to remove events from calendar b."}}}

